ssg-override
fidelity min
# An SSG override in place of the YM2203's SSG: it is told of the prescale
# as the chip is made, then reset; it takes every SSG write and data-port
# read, and every prescale write tells it again; the SSG outputs, never
# written, stay 0, and the FM plays on.
